From: Gilly1970 <gilroyscott@hotmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] thermal: airoha: fix sensor interval field mask

EN7581_TEMPMONCTL2 programs the filter interval and sensor interval
through separate fields. The driver used EN7581_FILT_INTERVAL for both
FIELD_PREP() calls, so the sensor interval value was encoded with the
wrong mask.

Use EN7581_SEN_INTERVAL for the sensor interval field.

Signed-off-by: Gilly1970 <gilroyscott@hotmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/thermal/airoha_thermal.c
+++ b/drivers/thermal/airoha_thermal.c
@@ -503,7 +503,7 @@
 	 */
 	regmap_write(priv->map, EN7581_TEMPMONCTL2,
 		     FIELD_PREP(EN7581_FILT_INTERVAL, 1) |
-		     FIELD_PREP(EN7581_FILT_INTERVAL, 379));
+		     FIELD_PREP(EN7581_SEN_INTERVAL, 379));
 
 	/* AHB poll is set to 146 * 68.64 = 10.02us */
 	regmap_write(priv->map, EN7581_TEMPAHBPOLL,
